# The build context is the directory holding the checkouts, so start by
# excluding all of it and name the four the image needs. A neighbouring repo -
# a paper, a notebook, an unrelated clone - never enters the context.
*
!carp-dsp-portal
!carp-dsp
!carp.core-kotlin
!health-workflow-interfaces

# Then the noise inside them. Later patterns win, so these apply to the four
# directories re-included above.
**/.git
**/.gradle
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/build
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pixi
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
carp-dsp-portal/_stage
carp-dsp-portal/data
carp-dsp/carp.dsp.demo/results
carp-dsp/carp.dsp.demo/eval_results
